<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-jinshu" book-id="b-jinshu-055" chapter-id="c-jinshu-055-xiahou-cheng" source-id="s-jinshu-055-xiahou-cheng-ws2316433">
  <p id="c-jinshu-055-xiahou-cheng:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-jinshu-055-xiahou-cheng:p001:m0000" ref="aoi_obc_cmd">承</persName>，字<persName id="c-jinshu-055-xiahou-cheng:p001:m0003" ref="aoi_obc_cmd">文子</persName>。參安東軍事，稍遷南平太守。太興末，<persName id="c-jinshu-055-xiahou-cheng:p001:m0023" ref="39o_b6y_n74">王敦</persName>舉兵內向，<persName id="c-jinshu-055-xiahou-cheng:p001:m0030" ref="aoi_obc_cmd">承</persName>與梁州刺史<persName id="c-jinshu-055-xiahou-cheng:p001:m0036" ref="csn_tgm_oe7">甘卓</persName>、巴東監軍<persName id="c-jinshu-055-xiahou-cheng:p001:m0043" ref="xzj_9xb_s9b">柳純</persName>、宜都太守<persName id="c-jinshu-055-xiahou-cheng:p001:m0050" ref="b66_w3q_816">譚該</persName>等，並露檄遠近，列<persName id="c-jinshu-055-xiahou-cheng:p001:m0061" ref="39o_b6y_n74">敦</persName>罪狀。會<persName id="c-jinshu-055-xiahou-cheng:p001:m0066" ref="csn_tgm_oe7">甘卓</persName>懷疑不進，王師敗績，<persName id="c-jinshu-055-xiahou-cheng:p001:m0078" ref="39o_b6y_n74">敦</persName>悉誅滅異己者，收<persName id="c-jinshu-055-xiahou-cheng:p001:m0087" ref="aoi_obc_cmd">承</persName>，欲殺之，<persName id="c-jinshu-055-xiahou-cheng:p001:m0093" ref="aoi_obc_cmd">承</persName>外兄<persName id="c-jinshu-055-xiahou-cheng:p001:m0096" ref="kfe_jr6_cet">王暠</persName>苦請得免。尋為散騎常侍。</p>
</text>
